WEBVTT

01:33.410 --> 01:35.380
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.451 --> 01:37.880
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.951 --> 01:40.821
(Episode 26)

01:59.541 --> 02:00.300
You're back.

02:02.440 --> 02:03.410
It smells so good.

02:03.571 --> 02:04.981
I told you I'd make it in time for dinner.

02:05.041 --> 02:06.380
If you didn't, I'd beat you up.

02:06.440 --> 02:08.011
Look, they're all your favorite dishes.

02:11.050 --> 02:11.851
Go away.

02:13.421 --> 02:14.451
Come here. Have a seat.

02:15.121 --> 02:15.890
Let's eat.

02:19.321 --> 02:20.191
Doesn't it smell good?

02:20.620 --> 02:21.360
Let me try it.

02:27.131 --> 02:28.270
Is there something wrong with your eyes?

02:30.131 --> 02:31.471
You weren't at home.

02:32.671 --> 02:33.400
Where did you go?

02:33.900 --> 02:34.971
It's your brother's business.

02:35.411 --> 02:36.541
None of your business.

02:36.770 --> 02:37.671
I...

02:39.610 --> 02:40.610
Song Yan.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.851
You've gone astray.

02:42.381 --> 02:44.011
You went out to play without me.

02:45.180 --> 02:45.921
Aunt.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.981
This is really delicious.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.390
I made it especially for you.

02:50.090 --> 02:51.691
Mom, he ignored me.

02:51.761 --> 02:52.890
The shrimp is really good.

02:52.960 --> 02:53.691
It's high in protein and low in fat.

02:53.761 --> 02:55.191
- You must eat more. - I'll have some.

02:55.261 --> 02:56.691
You're ignoring me too.

02:56.830 --> 02:57.531
You're Miao Miao.

03:08.710 --> 03:10.441
Aunt, Miao Miao.

03:12.411 --> 03:13.580
Xu Qin and I...

03:14.951 --> 03:15.751
are dating.

03:23.251 --> 03:24.120
No, I mean...

03:26.090 --> 03:27.721
- Let's eat. - Mom.

03:28.261 --> 03:29.390
- Why are you... - Come on.

03:29.460 --> 03:30.691
This is good too.

03:30.830 --> 03:32.060
Mom, what are you doing?

03:32.330 --> 03:33.800
Eat more.

03:34.131 --> 03:35.400
Eat up.

03:35.900 --> 03:36.701
Song Yan.

03:37.201 --> 03:37.900
Then...

03:41.511 --> 03:42.770
Come on. Let's eat.

03:43.411 --> 03:44.941
Look, you got food all over your mouth.

03:45.340 --> 03:46.441
Just like when you were a kid.

03:51.210 --> 03:52.050
Instructor.

03:52.180 --> 03:52.921
So?

03:53.851 --> 03:55.390
I think we need to find someone more professional...

03:55.451 --> 03:56.291
to talk to them.

03:57.020 --> 03:59.161
Why don't we get a psychiatrist from the hospital?

03:59.221 --> 04:00.221
We have one already.

04:00.291 --> 04:01.191
Li Meng.

04:01.261 --> 04:02.860
She studied psychology in college.

04:02.930 --> 04:04.390
I think she even has a license...

04:04.460 --> 04:05.900
as a psychological counselor.

04:07.360 --> 04:08.131
That's right.

04:08.471 --> 04:09.731
She even gave us counseling.

04:09.971 --> 04:11.201
Really?

04:11.370 --> 04:12.400
I'll contact her.

04:14.740 --> 04:16.740
Have you thought about it?

04:17.171 --> 04:18.210
I have.

04:18.640 --> 04:19.610
This injury is nothing.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.441
I can still be on the frontline for a few more years.

04:23.610 --> 04:24.411
Song Yan.

04:24.581 --> 04:27.050
Because of you, our higher-up has had...

04:27.320 --> 04:28.820
three meetings.

04:30.620 --> 04:32.690
He wants you to take on more responsibilities,

04:32.760 --> 04:34.320
so that your abilities...

04:34.490 --> 04:36.260
can be brought into full play.

04:36.331 --> 04:38.831
If you go to a higher position,

04:38.901 --> 04:40.700
you'll be able to...

04:42.671 --> 04:43.630
Right?

04:45.141 --> 04:47.541
You can't keep standing in the same spot.

04:47.601 --> 04:49.171
You have to seek progress to improve.

04:50.341 --> 04:51.411
I know.

04:53.411 --> 04:55.151
When the time comes and I can't walk anymore,

04:55.610 --> 04:56.651
I'll report to you.

05:02.021 --> 05:04.651
I know you can't bear to leave Shilitai,

05:04.721 --> 05:07.161
but you have to think about your future.

05:07.891 --> 05:09.291
You have to get married and have a family.

05:09.360 --> 05:10.831
You're not young anymore.

05:16.401 --> 05:18.070
Go to your office.

05:18.541 --> 05:20.300
You're always...

05:21.000 --> 05:22.271
teetering in front of me.

05:22.341 --> 05:23.010
I'm sick of it.

05:25.911 --> 05:26.911
You're sick of me?

05:27.211 --> 05:28.141
You're sick of me.

05:29.211 --> 05:30.110
Hey.

05:30.810 --> 05:32.081
I'm not done yet.

05:33.421 --> 05:35.421
You always make me speechless.

05:44.291 --> 05:45.161
Give it to me.

05:47.661 --> 05:48.401
What's this?

05:48.901 --> 05:50.271
Brochures for the community?

05:51.700 --> 05:53.101
Yes, the weather is dry in winter.

05:53.341 --> 05:54.700
Fire prevention is critical.

05:55.641 --> 05:56.641
I'll open it for you.

05:56.771 --> 05:57.510
That's right.

05:58.141 --> 05:59.411
Lunar New Year is in a month.

05:59.841 --> 06:01.680
The fireworks in the city will make it even worse.

06:02.380 --> 06:03.411
Tell me about it.

06:05.151 --> 06:06.380
How's your injury?

06:06.680 --> 06:07.481
I'm fine now.

06:07.721 --> 06:08.651
I'll resume work next week.

06:12.990 --> 06:13.721
Here.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.500
I'm here to talk to you...

06:18.961 --> 06:20.161
about the team's mental state.

06:23.471 --> 06:24.671
Jiang Yu told me.

06:25.000 --> 06:27.171
Although a psychiatrist was arranged immediately,

06:27.500 --> 06:30.141
a few firefighters still haven't gotten through the trauma.

06:30.740 --> 06:31.711
But don't worry too much.

06:32.180 --> 06:33.240
I'll check up on them today.

06:33.981 --> 06:34.740
They'll be fine.

06:36.880 --> 06:37.750
I hope so.

06:39.281 --> 06:40.921
What about you? Are you okay?

06:42.221 --> 06:43.021
I'm okay.

06:45.820 --> 06:46.591
Of course.

06:47.260 --> 06:50.031
Our Chief has experienced a lot.

06:50.531 --> 06:51.560
He's mentally tough.

06:53.961 --> 06:55.671
Why does it sound like you're being sarcastic?

06:56.700 --> 06:57.531
I wouldn't dare.

07:03.610 --> 07:04.440
Let's gossip.

07:05.641 --> 07:06.481
About what?

07:07.581 --> 07:08.481
You...

07:08.851 --> 07:10.281
and that doctor.

07:13.880 --> 07:15.190
She's my girlfriend now.

07:19.190 --> 07:19.990
Congratulations.

07:21.091 --> 07:21.831
Thank you.

07:22.630 --> 07:23.630
But Song Yan,

07:24.130 --> 07:26.060
she's at the top of your food chain.

07:26.260 --> 07:28.000
She has you wrapped around her finger.

07:29.971 --> 07:30.800
Don't worry.

07:31.971 --> 07:33.041
She can't leave me either.

07:33.740 --> 07:34.671
I'm off.

07:43.050 --> 07:45.050
(Messages)

08:22.721 --> 08:23.620
Jiang Yi.

08:24.791 --> 08:25.490
Instructor.

08:26.060 --> 08:26.990
Catch.

08:27.161 --> 08:28.091
Let's play two rounds.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.231
Instructor.

08:30.630 --> 08:31.430
I'm okay.

08:31.860 --> 08:32.731
I'll be fine in a few days.

08:32.800 --> 08:33.731
Don't worry.

08:35.130 --> 08:36.300
Sit down. Let's chat.

08:37.531 --> 08:38.471
Okay.

08:50.180 --> 08:50.980
Instructor.

08:52.080 --> 08:52.950
I'm really fine.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.350
Don't worry about me.

08:58.820 --> 09:00.060
In our line of work,

09:00.291 --> 09:01.960
it's often a matter of life and death.

09:02.090 --> 09:04.131
Sometimes, a moment of carelessness or hesitation...

09:04.460 --> 09:06.300
may lead to paying the price of life.

09:07.560 --> 09:08.501
As for me,

09:08.700 --> 09:09.830
as an instructor,

09:09.901 --> 09:11.371
I hope I have the ability...

09:11.570 --> 09:12.700
and responsibility...

09:12.940 --> 09:14.300
to help you adjust.

09:15.100 --> 09:16.771
I also wish I could help you...

09:17.611 --> 09:18.980
as a buddy and a friend.

09:19.810 --> 09:20.810
I've been a firefighter for eight years.

09:22.651 --> 09:23.950
I've been on thousands of missions.

09:25.820 --> 09:27.050
Tough situations like this...

09:27.980 --> 09:28.991
are not new to me.

09:33.820 --> 09:34.891
But it's different this time.

09:38.131 --> 09:39.161
You've been performing your duty for eight years...

09:40.330 --> 09:41.460
and saved thousands of lives.

09:43.100 --> 09:44.171
What's different this time?

09:46.501 --> 09:47.871
This time, my mom was in the disaster zone.

09:51.310 --> 09:52.310
My dad passed away when I was young.

09:54.281 --> 09:55.611
My mom raised me on her own.

09:58.350 --> 09:59.781
She had a hard time in her early years.

10:00.521 --> 10:01.521
I have yet to have the time...

10:02.521 --> 10:03.820
to take care of her.

10:07.060 --> 10:07.960
I don't even dare to think...

10:09.291 --> 10:11.060
that what if my mom died...

10:12.930 --> 10:13.960
during the earthquake this time?

10:15.570 --> 10:16.700
What should I do?

10:17.700 --> 10:18.970
I've saved so many people.

10:20.800 --> 10:23.041
But when my own mom is in danger,

10:24.771 --> 10:26.940
I am unable to show up for her right away.

10:27.340 --> 10:28.281
To help her.

10:30.651 --> 10:32.550
When I can't even protect my own family,

10:36.121 --> 10:38.251
what right do I have to protect the people...

10:38.891 --> 10:39.820
and society?

10:44.261 --> 10:45.901
I'm not a good son.

10:50.700 --> 10:52.340
I've shamed the badge on my chest.

10:55.741 --> 10:56.511
Filial piety...

10:58.111 --> 10:59.310
is our root.

11:00.011 --> 11:01.840
There's nothing to be ashamed of when it comes to family.

11:03.011 --> 11:03.810
I just think...

11:04.381 --> 11:05.850
you have too much on your mind.

11:09.291 --> 11:10.491
We have much to shoulder.

11:12.421 --> 11:13.261
Big family.

11:13.491 --> 11:14.421
Small family.

11:15.391 --> 11:16.261
Everyone.

11:17.690 --> 11:18.590
Right?

11:24.200 --> 11:25.131
I understand where you're coming from.

11:26.570 --> 11:27.470
Instructor.

11:28.100 --> 11:28.940
Don't worry.

11:29.940 --> 11:30.741
I will...

11:30.911 --> 11:32.310
try my best to adjust myself.

11:33.180 --> 11:35.141
But my original passion for firefighting...

11:36.251 --> 11:37.480
has never changed.

11:39.021 --> 11:40.281
That's what I'm most proud of.

11:43.291 --> 11:44.450
For the earthquake rescue this time,

11:45.690 --> 11:47.161
it's the first time a lot of new members...

11:47.421 --> 11:49.330
are taking part in such a big mission.

11:50.230 --> 11:51.560
Go and give them some concern.

11:52.501 --> 11:53.901
I'm a veteran. I'll be fine.

11:54.460 --> 11:56.570
Forget them. Worry about yourself first.

11:57.930 --> 11:58.940
Let's play...

12:00.771 --> 12:01.600
two rounds.

12:02.141 --> 12:03.041
One-on-one.

12:03.241 --> 12:04.141
The whole court.

12:08.480 --> 12:09.781
Come on.

12:09.850 --> 12:11.281
I'll attack first.

12:29.230 --> 12:30.401
(Song Yan)

12:34.470 --> 12:36.041
(Li Meng)

12:48.021 --> 12:50.751
(Why haven't you texted me all day?)

12:51.621 --> 12:58.261
(Are we boyfriend and girlfriend?)

13:10.210 --> 13:12.810
(What are you up to?)

13:17.680 --> 13:19.521
(Miss me?)

13:22.391 --> 13:24.720
(Yes.)

13:35.161 --> 13:38.131
(I'll go to you. Be there in ten minutes.)

13:40.501 --> 13:42.641
(Okay.)

14:28.621 --> 14:29.621
Welcome.

14:31.421 --> 14:32.521
Did you miss me?

14:33.021 --> 14:33.820
No.

14:34.820 --> 14:36.460
I just called you over to see you.

14:37.161 --> 14:38.930
In case I forget what you look like.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.060
You're right.

14:42.570 --> 14:43.800
Do you have a bad memory?

14:45.741 --> 14:46.741
Take a good look.

14:52.781 --> 14:53.641
Do you remember it now?

14:55.611 --> 14:56.651
I've seen enough.

14:57.381 --> 14:58.310
You've seen enough?

14:59.080 --> 15:00.021
All right then.

15:00.220 --> 15:01.021
I'll get going.

15:10.830 --> 15:11.631
I miss you.

15:14.330 --> 15:15.330
That's more like it.

15:15.970 --> 15:16.930
If you miss me,

15:17.200 --> 15:18.131
then say it.

15:34.651 --> 15:35.550
A safety hammer?

15:35.651 --> 15:36.491
That's right.

15:37.151 --> 15:38.251
When there's an emergency...

15:38.320 --> 15:39.661
and you're trapped in the car,

15:39.791 --> 15:41.121
use this to break the window.

15:42.161 --> 15:42.960
Remember.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.930
Hit the corners.

15:45.491 --> 15:46.430
Don't hit the center.

15:46.501 --> 15:47.330
The center...

15:47.800 --> 15:48.800
doesn't break easily.

15:49.171 --> 15:50.131
Got it?

15:50.930 --> 15:51.771
Yes.

15:54.970 --> 15:55.871
I'll put it here.

16:01.840 --> 16:02.651
Fire extinguisher.

16:03.680 --> 16:04.550
How do I use it?

16:04.651 --> 16:06.450
It's easy. Look.

16:08.281 --> 16:09.320
There's a pin here.

16:09.991 --> 16:11.121
Give it a twist,

16:11.320 --> 16:12.921
then pull it out.

16:13.661 --> 16:14.891
When you want to use it,

16:14.960 --> 16:15.891
give this a press.

16:16.291 --> 16:17.361
That's all. It's simple.

16:17.730 --> 16:18.491
Give it a try.

16:22.131 --> 16:23.001
Here.

16:25.600 --> 16:26.340
Ready?

16:27.741 --> 16:31.041
One, two, three.

16:39.320 --> 16:40.251
Got it?

16:42.121 --> 16:42.921
This thing...

16:44.090 --> 16:45.491
I hope you never have to use it.

16:51.491 --> 16:52.430
Where should I put this?

16:53.430 --> 16:55.001
Take this home. It's useless now.

16:55.261 --> 16:56.570
Put this new one in the car.

16:58.001 --> 16:58.871
Here.

16:59.341 --> 17:00.471
Whether it's those...

17:00.670 --> 17:02.180
who died in the disaster...

17:02.680 --> 17:04.310
or our own teammate who got hurt,

17:04.650 --> 17:05.751
it's not your fault.

17:07.350 --> 17:09.751
In this world, there are many uncertainties.

17:10.080 --> 17:12.290
Disasters are also part of it.

17:13.290 --> 17:14.360
Next,

17:14.620 --> 17:16.560
I'm going to show you some videos.

17:17.530 --> 17:20.060
It shows the situation of the earthquake relief at Wangxiang,

17:20.590 --> 17:22.661
and information on other disaster relief.

17:23.261 --> 17:24.800
Like I said in the beginning,

17:25.171 --> 17:26.001
trauma...

17:26.231 --> 17:27.701
is a very painful...

17:27.870 --> 17:28.800
and scary experience.

17:29.840 --> 17:31.941
People always avoid it.

17:32.471 --> 17:34.011
But avoiding it won't solve the problem.

17:34.441 --> 17:35.310
These things...

17:35.640 --> 17:37.280
will help us understand...

17:37.580 --> 17:39.880
and accept the trauma and anxiety.

17:40.080 --> 17:41.080
It's not dangerous.

17:41.481 --> 17:43.181
We can overcome those memories.

17:44.290 --> 17:45.421
Instead of letting those memories...

17:46.221 --> 17:47.090
overcome you.

17:50.620 --> 17:51.991
Ms. Li is right.

17:52.830 --> 17:54.461
Yes. Come on, let's watch it together.

17:55.060 --> 17:57.970
Help! My wife has fainted!

17:58.171 --> 17:59.201
Everyone, come!

17:59.201 --> 18:00.411
What are you scared of?

18:00.471 --> 18:02.070
Just watch it if you have to, right?

18:02.141 --> 18:03.381
Come on, raise your head.

18:06.550 --> 18:07.780
Let me tell you a story.

18:08.310 --> 18:09.750
When I first became a firefighter...

18:09.851 --> 18:10.851
and went into a fire for the first time,

18:10.921 --> 18:13.290
it was way more dramatic than what you two saw.

18:13.421 --> 18:14.550
I was so scared.

18:15.421 --> 18:16.490
After I returned to the fire station,

18:17.121 --> 18:17.961
for three months,

18:18.520 --> 18:19.730
I couldn't eat meat.

18:20.161 --> 18:21.590
- Yes. I know that. - Just one look...

18:21.861 --> 18:22.661
This won't do.

18:22.961 --> 18:24.431
- I won't describe it to you two. - Let's wait and see.

18:24.601 --> 18:26.570
Back then, my instructor said this to me.

18:27.030 --> 18:28.601
He said, "Yang Chi."

18:29.030 --> 18:30.040
"What are you afraid of?"

18:30.171 --> 18:31.441
"You're a man."

18:32.040 --> 18:33.510
"Look at what you're afraid of."

18:33.810 --> 18:34.810
"The more afraid you are, the more you look."

18:34.871 --> 18:35.840
"Look until you're not afraid anymore."

18:36.240 --> 18:38.240
Don't think too much, right?

18:38.381 --> 18:39.280
Well...

18:39.510 --> 18:41.181
Even Ms. Li is here with us.

18:41.280 --> 18:42.250
Let's watch it. Come on.

18:42.451 --> 18:43.451
Raise your heads.

18:43.750 --> 18:44.621
Come on.

18:44.951 --> 18:46.651
We're men, right?

18:46.721 --> 18:48.351
There's nothing to be afraid of. Come on.

18:49.050 --> 18:50.060
Let's watch together.

18:51.361 --> 18:52.661
What's so scary about this? Look.

18:56.330 --> 18:57.201
At this time,

18:57.260 --> 18:58.601
keep breathing.

18:59.201 --> 19:00.971
- Ge Zheng. - Breathe.

19:01.730 --> 19:02.500
Breathe.

19:02.601 --> 19:04.340
Breathe in and out slowly.

19:07.671 --> 19:09.010
Steady your breathing.

19:09.070 --> 19:09.810
Breathe in.

19:10.580 --> 19:11.480
Breathe out.

19:23.020 --> 19:24.661
Relax.

19:34.901 --> 19:36.101
Thank you for today.

19:37.000 --> 19:38.040
I appreciate it.

19:38.101 --> 19:39.040
It's what I should do.

19:39.101 --> 19:40.340
Thanks for being our psychological counselor.

19:40.411 --> 19:41.810
All right, go back.

19:41.871 --> 19:42.810
You don't have to see me out.

19:42.911 --> 19:43.711
Go back.

19:44.780 --> 19:45.540
Li Meng.

19:48.881 --> 19:49.711
This is for you.

19:52.020 --> 19:53.151
You're still writing greeting cards...

19:53.221 --> 19:54.221
in this era?

19:54.421 --> 19:55.391
So old-fashioned.

19:56.721 --> 19:58.260
The new year is starting.

19:59.221 --> 20:00.990
We should have a sense of ritual in life.

20:04.361 --> 20:05.830
Okay, thank you.

20:06.260 --> 20:07.131
Go back.

20:12.601 --> 20:14.010
(Take care of your back! Drink more warm water! Be happy!)

20:14.611 --> 20:17.111
(Take care of your back, drink more warm water!)

20:24.181 --> 20:25.050
Jiang Yu.

20:28.490 --> 20:29.290
It's nothing.

20:30.260 --> 20:31.121
Thanks.

20:33.461 --> 20:34.330
Go back.

20:38.361 --> 20:39.030
Thank you.

20:52.740 --> 20:53.510
Give it to me.

20:55.911 --> 20:56.721
By the way,

20:57.181 --> 20:59.621
did your meeting with Li Meng go well?

21:01.191 --> 21:02.590
Why are you asking about my work?

21:05.221 --> 21:06.060
It's nothing.

21:06.931 --> 21:07.931
I just feel...

21:08.760 --> 21:09.931
that you two seem close.

21:10.131 --> 21:10.861
So I'm asking.

21:15.471 --> 21:16.471
Are you jealous?

21:17.371 --> 21:18.270
No.

21:21.911 --> 21:22.871
Are you tired from work?

21:25.681 --> 21:27.181
Did you think about me today?

21:28.181 --> 21:29.381
Didn't you say you were busy...

21:30.421 --> 21:31.681
and to wait for your call?

21:35.651 --> 21:36.691
Song Yan.

21:36.861 --> 21:37.921
You're doing it on purpose, aren't you?

21:39.361 --> 21:40.161
What do you mean?

21:40.330 --> 21:41.330
You're leaving me hanging on purpose.

21:43.330 --> 21:45.060
I didn't want to disturb you at work.

21:45.361 --> 21:46.901
Look. I came as soon as you texted me.

21:47.230 --> 21:48.101
Right?

21:51.040 --> 21:51.840
I forgot.

21:54.641 --> 21:55.810
I almost forgot again.

21:56.270 --> 21:58.080
I have a lot of cases to review tonight.

21:58.510 --> 21:59.441
I'd probably be busy too.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.121
All right then.

22:04.881 --> 22:06.891
I won't bother you with your work.

22:08.421 --> 22:09.351
Rest early.

22:12.391 --> 22:13.290
Okay.

23:23.461 --> 23:24.260
All right.

23:24.530 --> 23:25.560
I won't tease you anymore.

23:27.230 --> 23:28.371
I just want to see...

23:28.431 --> 23:30.441
how long you'll hold it in before you say what's on your mind.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.570
You've changed over the years.

23:35.171 --> 23:36.371
You've learned to bottle things up.

23:38.980 --> 23:41.010
You used to be a snob.

23:53.530 --> 23:54.530
Tonight,

23:55.730 --> 23:57.101
do you have to review the cases?

23:58.560 --> 23:59.431
Of course.

24:20.820 --> 24:21.820
You're still up?

24:23.050 --> 24:24.891
You're breathing in my ear.

24:25.391 --> 24:26.161
It tickles.

24:32.661 --> 24:34.530
Actually, you wanted to throw a tantrum at me today, right?

24:36.530 --> 24:37.901
You blame me for not looking for you,

24:38.641 --> 24:39.671
texting you,

24:40.671 --> 24:41.540
or coaxing you.

24:43.580 --> 24:45.080
You're afraid I'll think you're acting up...

24:45.141 --> 24:46.080
and have a bad temper.

24:47.881 --> 24:49.010
Don't be like this anymore.

24:50.580 --> 24:51.651
We're going to get married...

24:51.721 --> 24:52.921
and live together for the rest of our lives.

24:53.820 --> 24:54.820
When you're with me,

24:57.290 --> 24:59.121
you don't have to worry so much.

25:05.661 --> 25:06.800
Sometimes,

25:07.730 --> 25:10.540
I'm so envious of girls who can talk with their eyes.

25:11.770 --> 25:13.641
I want to have eyes like that too.

25:14.171 --> 25:15.010
Why?

25:16.840 --> 25:17.980
Because even if...

25:18.780 --> 25:20.580
there are things I am unable to say,

25:21.651 --> 25:23.550
my eyes can still convey...

25:23.621 --> 25:25.280
my happiness or sadness.

25:33.461 --> 25:34.661
You don't need them.

25:37.730 --> 25:39.000
I can tell.

26:05.590 --> 26:06.691
They're out of cereal.

26:07.490 --> 26:08.361
Really?

26:10.901 --> 26:12.530
It was always here.

26:13.361 --> 26:15.371
Maybe they haven't stocked it up.

26:18.300 --> 26:19.141
Maybe.

26:19.901 --> 26:21.070
We'll buy it next time.

26:33.621 --> 26:35.191
I'll come again after work.

26:35.651 --> 26:36.520
Okay.

26:42.431 --> 26:43.490
What do you want for dinner?

26:43.701 --> 26:44.601
Let's get takeout.

26:46.101 --> 26:47.871
Can you surprise me?

26:49.770 --> 26:51.340
I'll surprise you every day from now on.

27:18.560 --> 27:19.461
What's wrong?

27:21.530 --> 27:22.871
The scar on your shoulder...

27:23.171 --> 27:24.070
is weird.

27:25.540 --> 27:26.570
You know what I do for a living.

27:26.901 --> 27:28.211
Isn't it normal to have a scar?

27:29.911 --> 27:31.141
It looks like a gunshot wound.

27:36.250 --> 27:38.080
You're so imaginative.

27:39.381 --> 27:40.320
This scar...

27:40.621 --> 27:42.050
was from a piece of glass.

27:44.661 --> 27:45.421
Dr. Xu.

27:46.020 --> 27:47.090
If you don't leave now,

27:49.030 --> 27:50.631
I'll make sure you'll be late.

27:59.270 --> 28:00.000
Let's go.

28:00.770 --> 28:01.671
All right.

28:10.550 --> 28:11.851
- Good morning, Dr. Xu. - Good morning.

28:12.020 --> 28:13.451
- Dr. Xu. - Good morning.

28:13.580 --> 28:14.550
Good morning, Dr. Xu.

28:14.621 --> 28:16.721
Dr. Xu, you used to come 15 minutes early.

28:16.790 --> 28:17.990
Why are you late these days?

28:18.221 --> 28:19.461
I wake up late these days.

28:21.490 --> 28:22.260
Dr. Xu.

28:22.391 --> 28:23.560
Are you tired lately?

28:24.101 --> 28:25.530
But why do I feel like...

28:25.701 --> 28:27.070
you look much better than before?

28:28.171 --> 28:29.371
Your face looks rosy...

28:29.431 --> 28:30.500
and moisturized.

28:32.770 --> 28:34.540
Dr. Xu, have you had breakfast?

28:35.070 --> 28:36.941
I have some yogurt drinks. Do you want one?

28:37.340 --> 28:38.441
I ate at home.

28:41.980 --> 28:43.010
Did you notice?

28:43.411 --> 28:45.221
I think Dr. Xu is in love.

28:45.381 --> 28:47.391
I can feel a hint of happiness...

28:47.651 --> 28:48.621
in the air.

28:49.820 --> 28:51.020
That's impossible.

28:51.661 --> 28:53.661
I don't think she has changed.

28:54.490 --> 28:55.990
Such terrible observation skills.

28:56.090 --> 28:57.961
There's no difference when she's working.

28:58.361 --> 28:59.701
But didn't you notice?

28:59.830 --> 29:01.570
She never touched her phone before.

29:01.901 --> 29:03.631
Nowadays, her keyboard clacks all day...

29:03.701 --> 29:05.000
and she even covers her mouth and smiles.

29:07.810 --> 29:08.871
I heard that.

29:11.711 --> 29:12.711
Let's get to work.

29:12.881 --> 29:14.280
Don't rush me.

29:25.621 --> 29:28.191
(Imported cereals and supplements)

29:33.000 --> 29:33.971
Excuse me.

29:34.230 --> 29:36.330
I'd like to ask about Xinle Cereal.

29:36.431 --> 29:37.500
Why hasn't it been in stock?

29:38.070 --> 29:38.941
It won't be stocked anymore.

29:39.000 --> 29:40.611
That factory is about to close down.

29:54.391 --> 29:55.290
Come in.

29:56.421 --> 29:57.260
Mr. Meng.

29:58.391 --> 29:59.490
This is the proposal...

30:00.431 --> 30:02.060
and this is next week's schedule.

30:03.090 --> 30:04.560
We have to go to Guokun on Monday...

30:04.631 --> 30:06.101
for the annual summary meeting.

30:08.371 --> 30:09.530
Take care of this.

30:11.840 --> 30:13.500
(Purchase of Xinle Cereal Factory)

30:15.941 --> 30:17.240
You're acquiring a cereal factory?

30:18.480 --> 30:19.340
Is there a problem?

30:20.611 --> 30:22.611
No. I'll arrange for some research.

30:23.280 --> 30:24.050
Go ahead.

30:38.961 --> 30:39.931
Hello?

30:40.131 --> 30:41.371
You've been back for so long.

30:41.570 --> 30:42.230
If I didn't look for you,

30:42.371 --> 30:43.671
won't you show some care for me?

30:43.871 --> 30:45.971
Didn't I just call you yesterday?

30:46.101 --> 30:47.570
Does telling me to come home for dinner this weekend...

30:47.671 --> 30:48.770
count as caring?

30:48.911 --> 30:50.810
Meng Yan Chen, are you still a baby?

30:52.711 --> 30:54.611
Why is your hospital playing music?

30:54.780 --> 30:56.451
I'm at the mall to catch a meal.

30:57.480 --> 30:58.480
With whom?

30:59.520 --> 31:00.490
My colleagues.

31:01.050 --> 31:02.820
You're getting closer to your colleagues?

31:03.891 --> 31:05.090
Are you mocking me?

31:05.461 --> 31:06.490
I care about you.

31:07.290 --> 31:08.431
Okay, I'll talk to you later.

31:20.871 --> 31:22.310
What kind of place is this? What's good to eat here?

31:22.371 --> 31:23.881
- How is it? - It's good.

31:23.941 --> 31:25.510
I'll get going.

31:26.840 --> 31:27.651
All right.

31:29.010 --> 31:29.851
Wait for me here.

31:31.250 --> 31:33.990
(Yuexin Restaurant)

31:35.891 --> 31:36.651
Qin Er.

31:38.320 --> 31:39.621
Xiao Yi Xiao, why are you here?

31:40.121 --> 31:41.530
My friend and I are here for a meal too.

31:42.131 --> 31:42.931
You...

31:44.300 --> 31:45.760
- Let me introduce you. - Song Yan.

31:45.901 --> 31:46.830
I know you.

31:47.030 --> 31:48.201
I saw you get drunk...

31:48.270 --> 31:49.371
and go crazy at others last time.

31:49.431 --> 31:50.230
Did you forget?

31:54.211 --> 31:54.971
Hi.

31:56.770 --> 31:57.980
All right, I...

31:58.040 --> 31:59.010
I won't disturb you then.

31:59.080 --> 31:59.881
Eat up.

31:59.980 --> 32:01.010
Xiao Yi Xiao.

32:01.911 --> 32:02.911
It depends on my mood.

32:10.191 --> 32:11.320
Come on. Eat more.

32:22.131 --> 32:23.070
Thank you.

32:32.911 --> 32:34.780
You don't dance or flirt with anyone.

32:34.851 --> 32:35.750
Instead, you come to me every day.

32:35.810 --> 32:36.881
What a waste.

32:38.651 --> 32:39.980
Well, today calls for a celebration.

32:40.280 --> 32:41.221
What for?

32:41.391 --> 32:43.621
The company's performance has doubled.

32:44.490 --> 32:45.520
Will this reason do?

32:46.060 --> 32:46.921
Come on.

32:46.990 --> 32:48.030
Do you even care about that?

32:48.330 --> 32:49.490
If you said...

32:49.560 --> 32:51.330
you were celebrating for catching a bug or something,

32:51.661 --> 32:53.230
I can somehow believe it.

32:58.171 --> 32:59.101
What's wrong?

32:59.340 --> 33:00.240
Nothing.

33:02.310 --> 33:04.141
I'm just feeling listless.

33:06.211 --> 33:07.611
Did you notice that they...

33:09.010 --> 33:09.881
Notice what?

33:11.080 --> 33:11.851
Nothing.

33:12.421 --> 33:13.580
I noticed...

33:13.820 --> 33:15.590
that life is too comfortable for you.

33:15.750 --> 33:16.691
You have too much free time.

33:19.060 --> 33:20.320
I don't even remember...

33:20.691 --> 33:23.260
when was the last time I felt comfortable.

33:25.560 --> 33:26.560
I'll make you a drink.

33:36.141 --> 33:37.311
Where's that waitress?

33:37.940 --> 33:38.940
Which one?

33:39.411 --> 33:41.780
The one you said looked like someone.

33:42.050 --> 33:43.110
The part-timer?

33:43.681 --> 33:44.581
I don't know.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.920
I think she said...

33:46.880 --> 33:47.891
she's becoming an influencer.

33:48.550 --> 33:49.820
Why do you care about her?

33:50.391 --> 33:51.260
I don't.

33:52.190 --> 33:53.891
I just hope she's not going astray.

33:57.501 --> 33:58.300
You...

33:59.061 --> 34:00.561
You're all kind again.

34:03.300 --> 34:05.141
Don't you have anything better to do?

34:05.701 --> 34:06.701
The fact that you're too soft-hearted...

34:07.070 --> 34:08.740
makes you not cut out to be a businessman.

34:08.811 --> 34:09.670
Tell that...

34:10.710 --> 34:12.311
to Mrs. Fu.

34:14.610 --> 34:15.880
I still want to live.

34:16.351 --> 34:17.251
You know it.

34:17.981 --> 34:19.081
I've been afraid of her since I was little.

35:10.630 --> 35:11.400
- Hurry. - Come on.

35:11.541 --> 35:12.670
The weather is nice today.

35:15.170 --> 35:17.340
It took me a long time to find this place.

35:17.411 --> 35:18.240
Really?

35:18.780 --> 35:20.380
The sun is so warm today.

35:20.440 --> 35:21.451
Yes, it's not that cold.

35:21.811 --> 35:22.880
It's perfect for taking photos.

35:22.951 --> 35:23.951
The women's apparel we brought this time...

35:24.010 --> 35:25.420
are quite a lot.

35:26.851 --> 35:28.090
It's so beautiful.

35:29.291 --> 35:30.320
Look. What do you think?

35:32.121 --> 35:33.490
- Is it okay? - It's so nice.

35:33.590 --> 35:35.130
Ye Zi, how did you find this place?

35:35.431 --> 35:36.561
Don't worry about it.

35:36.630 --> 35:37.431
This is great.

35:37.731 --> 35:38.661
The clothes we're shooting this time...

35:38.731 --> 35:40.161
will surely sell a lot.

35:40.460 --> 35:42.101
Then we'll have money to donate to the disaster area.

35:42.170 --> 35:43.300
Of course.

35:43.371 --> 35:44.771
Stop talking. Let's get started.

36:04.891 --> 36:05.820
This place is good.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.791
- This is nice. - Okay.

36:07.860 --> 36:09.190
Let's take one against the window.

36:09.360 --> 36:10.090
Sure.

36:10.900 --> 36:12.360
How's the spot?

36:14.431 --> 36:15.300
Good.

36:24.880 --> 36:25.740
Who is it?

36:27.210 --> 36:28.581
Someone I used to know.

36:29.811 --> 36:30.610
Right,

36:30.681 --> 36:32.221
I think his office is nearby.

36:32.420 --> 36:34.751
I think we've entered their private property.

36:35.291 --> 36:36.090
Well...

36:36.221 --> 36:38.221
- Should we go say hi? - That's right.

36:40.621 --> 36:41.791
I'll go and say hi.

36:41.860 --> 36:42.990
Wait for me here.

36:43.061 --> 36:44.061
Okay, we'll wait for you.

36:56.311 --> 36:57.141
Mr. Meng.

36:58.081 --> 36:58.911
I'm sorry.

36:59.181 --> 36:59.911
My friends and I...

36:59.981 --> 37:01.610
were looking for a place to take photos.

37:01.751 --> 37:03.280
We didn't know it was near your office.

37:03.550 --> 37:05.751
So I thought I should come and say hi.

37:06.081 --> 37:07.021
No.

37:07.550 --> 37:09.221
This terrace is semi-closed.

37:09.751 --> 37:10.420
It's sort of...

37:10.490 --> 37:11.860
the public area of this office building.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.221
That's good.

37:13.661 --> 37:15.030
We were worried about whether...

37:15.090 --> 37:16.061
we could post the photos we took...

37:16.431 --> 37:18.431
and thought we came today for nothing.

37:20.900 --> 37:21.871
What photos?

37:23.030 --> 37:24.070
Like influencers?

37:24.541 --> 37:26.471
We're going to donate the proceeds from the goods...

37:26.541 --> 37:28.170
to the Wangxiang disaster area.

37:36.710 --> 37:37.751
Aren't you cold?

37:38.121 --> 37:39.420
We brought warm clothes.

37:39.621 --> 37:40.550
They're in the luggage.

37:45.490 --> 37:46.360
Excuse me.

37:46.690 --> 37:48.431
Four coffees for this lady.

37:48.661 --> 37:49.460
Okay.

37:49.630 --> 37:50.630
Thank you, Mr. Meng.

38:00.400 --> 38:02.240
- Ye Zi. - Coffee for you guys.

38:02.311 --> 38:03.240
My friend just bought it.

38:03.710 --> 38:05.541
That's great. I'm so thirsty.

38:05.610 --> 38:07.141
- Miao Miao. - Thank you.

38:08.550 --> 38:09.280
Ye Zi.

38:09.351 --> 38:10.681
Your friend is a CEO, isn't he?

38:10.951 --> 38:12.121
He looks so young.

38:12.181 --> 38:13.351
He's quite handsome.

38:13.420 --> 38:14.550
How is he handsome?

38:14.621 --> 38:15.351
He's so-so.

38:15.690 --> 38:17.251
- He's so handsome. - Yes.

38:19.190 --> 38:21.090
Ye Zi, how did you two meet?

38:23.831 --> 38:26.030
I used to be a designated driver, right?

38:26.101 --> 38:27.030
I just...

38:27.130 --> 38:28.670
What a good thing.

38:30.471 --> 38:31.400
Yes.

38:31.541 --> 38:33.001
Since he's from an investment company,

38:33.101 --> 38:34.740
why don't you ask him to invest in you?

38:36.240 --> 38:37.411
How is that possible?

38:37.940 --> 38:39.610
He invests in big projects.

38:40.141 --> 38:41.550
It's almost time. Let's hurry and shoot.

38:41.610 --> 38:42.451
Else, we won't have enough daylight.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.710
- Let's go. - Let's go.

38:43.981 --> 38:44.880
(Guokun Group)

38:44.951 --> 38:46.920
The above is the annual situation of each branch.

38:46.981 --> 38:48.621
Next is a look at each subsidiary.

38:48.751 --> 38:50.851
In the past year, the revenue of the subsidiary...

38:51.021 --> 38:52.320
that has increased the most...

38:52.391 --> 38:53.661
is Yancheng Minghao Investment.

38:53.721 --> 38:54.960
The increase...

38:55.030 --> 38:56.831
is 100 percent and 120 percent.

38:57.090 --> 38:58.501
The second is Hongdao Technology...

38:58.561 --> 38:59.701
with an increase...

38:59.760 --> 39:01.701
of 78 percent and 86 percent.

39:02.030 --> 39:04.740
This is the annual sales report of our subsidiaries.

39:05.001 --> 39:06.701
Last year's sales...

39:06.771 --> 39:07.940
of Yancheng Minghao Investment...

39:08.010 --> 39:09.570
was 31.6 billion.

39:09.971 --> 39:12.280
The year-over-year growth is 37.9 percent.

39:12.340 --> 39:13.510
The annual sales goal...

39:13.581 --> 39:14.981
was 5.3 billion.

39:15.510 --> 39:18.050
The goal completion rate is 84.7 percent.

39:18.380 --> 39:20.351
Congratulations, Mr. Meng Yan Chen.

39:27.291 --> 39:29.731
Next, we have Hongdao Technology.

39:29.960 --> 39:31.161
Last year's sales...

39:31.231 --> 39:32.561
were 2.35 billion.

39:32.630 --> 39:34.570
The year-over-year growth is 25 percent.

39:39.541 --> 39:41.610
Yan Chen is really making his dad proud.

39:41.771 --> 39:43.141
He's becoming so brilliant.

39:43.940 --> 39:45.041
It's just a little hustle.

39:46.010 --> 39:47.010
You're being modest.

39:47.641 --> 39:49.210
The way I see it,

39:49.411 --> 39:50.510
sooner or later,

39:50.751 --> 39:51.820
Guokun will be handed over to him.

39:52.380 --> 39:54.891
Guokun will only be handed over to the capable.

39:55.050 --> 39:56.550
Besides, Yan Chen currently...

39:56.621 --> 39:58.621
isn't really interested in the group's affairs.

39:59.021 --> 40:01.030
He only cares about his matters.

40:01.630 --> 40:03.161
Even if his mom couldn't urge him.

40:03.231 --> 40:05.260
We can only respect his wishes.

40:07.061 --> 40:07.800
Is that so?

40:07.871 --> 40:09.501
It's hard to say if he's interested.

40:09.701 --> 40:10.731
What if...

40:11.170 --> 40:12.800
he's a wolf in sheep's clothing?

40:16.710 --> 40:17.981
Are you sure you don't want to get involved...

40:18.181 --> 40:19.010
in the group's affairs?

40:21.581 --> 40:23.280
Guokun already has a good system...

40:23.650 --> 40:25.481
of professional managers and executives.

40:25.550 --> 40:26.751
The thing is,

40:26.820 --> 40:29.550
most of these people were trained by Dong Cheng Min.

40:29.820 --> 40:31.490
Once I retire and lose my power...

40:31.661 --> 40:33.891
Dad, you'll be retired anyway.

40:34.460 --> 40:35.731
You should enjoy your retirement.

40:36.090 --> 40:37.161
Guokun's shares...

40:37.231 --> 40:38.331
are more than enough to last you a lifetime.

40:38.661 --> 40:40.360
Why care about these trivial matters?

40:40.530 --> 40:41.831
Then is he short of pension...

40:41.971 --> 40:43.130
when he retires?

40:43.670 --> 40:46.101
He's also afraid that he'll lose power.

40:46.371 --> 40:47.871
You're not even in the group yet,

40:48.411 --> 40:49.740
but he already feels threatened by you.

40:50.010 --> 40:51.380
Dong Cheng Min's opinion of me...

40:52.840 --> 40:54.550
is about to be out in the open.
